40:        run: printf '%s\n' "$PR_BODY" | python scripts/pr_body_lint.py -
GATE CHANGE: edits gate config .box-profile
GATE CHANGE: edits gate config .github/pull_request_template.md
GATE CHANGE: edits gate config .github/workflows/gate.yml
GATE CHANGE: edits gate config .github/workflows/pr-checks.yml
